1
00:00:01,03 --> 00:00:03,73
Mother,just once, can we go to lunch...
媽媽,能不能就那麼一次,我們一起吃飯時

2
00:00:03,93 --> 00:00:08,80
...and not talk about what I'm wearing or where my career is going?
你不要談論我的衣著和我的工作

3
00:00:09,00 --> 00:00:11,17
Or who I'm dating.
包括我和誰約會

4
00:00:11,94 --> 00:00:13,93
-Ready for the check? -God,yes.
-準備好買單了? -天哪,是的

5
00:00:14,14 --> 00:00:15,97
-I'll take it. -No,darling.
-我來吧. -不,親愛的

6
00:00:16,18 --> 00:00:21,01
I said I'll take it. Here,take it. Go. Run.
我說了我來.這裡,拿著,走,跑

7
00:00:22,48 --> 00:00:23,75
Very sweet.
真甜蜜啊

8
00:00:23,95 --> 00:00:26,11
-And on what they pay you -Career.
-他們到底為什麼給你工錢. -工作

9
00:00:27,72 --> 00:00:31,28
You don't have to worry about me. I'm doing fine.
你不用擔心我.我做的很好

10
00:00:31,49 --> 00:00:33,52
I'm afraid this has been denied.
我想這張卡被禁用了

11
00:00:34,30 --> 00:00:35,85
That's impossible.
這不可能

12
00:00:36,06 --> 00:00:39,36
That's all right,dear. Here you go.
好吧,親愛的,用這張吧

13
00:00:41,70 --> 00:00:43,90
The One With The Fake Monica
六人行 第1季 第21集 假莫妮卡

14
00:00:46,06 --> 00:00:55,00
-=BT之家DRM小組 http://bbs.btbbt.com=- 榮譽出品 河馬根據網絡字幕微調製作

15
00:01:29,98 --> 00:01:32,28
How'd someone get your card number?
怎麼會有人知道你的信用卡號碼?

16
00:01:32,49 --> 00:01:34,85
No idea. Look how much they spent.
我也不知道,你看他們花了多少錢

17
00:01:35,06 --> 00:01:38,79
You only have to pay for the stuff you bought.
你只須付你所買的東西

18
00:01:39,03 --> 00:01:41,72
Still,it's just such reckless spending.
我知道,他真是揮霍無度

19
00:01:41,96 --> 00:01:43,86
When somebody steals...
我想他偷去你的信用卡時

20
00:01:44,13 --> 00:01:47,00
...they've already thrown caution to the wind.
根本就已忘了王法

21
00:01:49,07 --> 00:01:54,01
Wow,what a geek. They spent $69. 95 on a Wonder Mop.
真是個變態,花了69.95元買「神奇拖把」

22
00:01:55,54 --> 00:01:56,81
That's me.
我買的

23
00:01:59,88 --> 00:02:02,91
You see,when I say geek,I mean
你看,我說變態,我的意思是

24
00:02:03,12 --> 00:02:07,21
The hell with it,you bought a $70 mop,you're a geek.
怎麼回事,你花了70塊買一把拖把,你是個變態

25
00:02:08,09 --> 00:02:12,15
Oh,yuck. Ross,he's doing it again.
哦,討厭.羅斯,他又這麼幹了

26
00:02:12,36 --> 00:02:14,45
Marcel,stop humping the lamp.
馬修,別再侵犯那盞燈了

27
00:02:14,66 --> 00:02:18,33
Stop humping. Now,Marcel,come Come here,Marcel.
停止侵犯.現在,馬修,過來,馬修

28
00:02:18,53 --> 00:02:21,33
Oh,no. Not in my room. I'll get him.
不,又到我房裡了,我去抓它出來

29
00:02:21,54 --> 00:02:24,03
You've got to do something about that.
羅斯,你得想辦法阻止

30
00:02:24,24 --> 00:02:26,30
What? It's just a phase.
什麼?這只是個階段

31
00:02:26,74 --> 00:02:29,30
Well,that's what we said about Joey.
我們當時也是這麼說喬伊的

32
00:02:31,15 --> 00:02:34,17
You'd think you would be more understanding.
你們能多給點理解嗎?

33
00:02:34,38 --> 00:02:36,28
I know. But we're not.
我明白.可是我們不能

34
00:02:36,78 --> 00:02:39,88
Would you all relax? It's not that big a deal.
你們冷靜點行嗎?這又沒什麼了不起

35
00:02:40,09 --> 00:02:43,85
-Marcel,stop it. Marcel. Bad monkey. -What?
-馬修,停,壞猴子 -又怎麼了?

36
00:02:44,36 --> 00:02:47,82
Let's say my Curious George is no longer curious.
我只能說,我的好奇喬治玩偶不再好奇

37
00:02:56,24 --> 00:02:59,10
You are not still going over that thing.
摩妮卡,你還是無法釋懷

38
00:02:59,31 --> 00:03:02,07
-This woman's living my life. -What?
-這女人過著我的生活 -什麼?

39
00:03:02,71 --> 00:03:06,15
She's living my life, and she's doing it better than me.
她過著我的生活,而且過得比我好

40
00:03:06,81 --> 00:03:11,38
Look at this. Look. She buys tickets to plays I wanna see.
看,她買的戲票是我一直想看的戲

41
00:03:11,75 --> 00:03:15,31
She shops where I'm afraid of the salespeople.
她買的衣服是我早就想買的

42
00:03:15,52 --> 00:03:19,32
-She spent $300 on art supplies. -You're not an artist.
-她花了三百塊買藝術用品 -你又不是藝術家

43
00:03:19,53 --> 00:03:22,76
I might be if I had the supplies.
如果有藝術用品,我或許已是個藝術家

44
00:03:23,50 --> 00:03:27,53
I mean,I could do all this stuff. Only I don't.
我本來可以的,只是現在不是

45
00:03:28,10 --> 00:03:30,57
Oh,Monica,come on. You do cool things.
摩妮卡,別洩氣,你做的工作很酷

46
00:03:30,77 --> 00:03:33,07
Really? Let's compare,shall we?
真的?我們來做比較,好嗎?

47
00:03:33,27 --> 00:03:36,18
Oh,it's so late for "shall we."
現在說「好嗎」有點太遲了

48
00:03:37,28 --> 00:03:39,47
Do I horseback ride in the park?
我到過公園騎馬嗎?

49
00:03:39,68 --> 00:03:43,81
-Do I take classes at the New School? -No.
-我在新學校上過課嗎? -沒有

50
00:03:44,49 --> 00:03:49,35
She's got everything I want, and she doesn't have my mother.
她擁有我想要的一切,而且她沒有我媽

51
00:03:57,70 --> 00:04:01,83
-How about Joey Paponi? -No,still too ethnic.
-喬依帕波尼如何? -不好,太有種族意味了

52
00:04:02,04 --> 00:04:06,37
-My agent wants a more neutral name. -Joey Switzerland?
-我的經紀人認為,我該取個中立一點的名字 -喬伊瑞士?

53
00:04:11,38 --> 00:04:17,01
Plus,I think it should be Joe. Joey makes me sound like I'm this big:
而且,我應該就是喬, 喬伊讓我感覺…這麼大

54
00:04:17,29 --> 00:04:18,38
Which I'm not.
可我不是

55
00:04:20,99 --> 00:04:24,29
Joe,Joe,Joe Stalin?
喬…喬斯大林?

56
00:04:26,13 --> 00:04:27,39
Stalin.
斯大林

57
00:04:28,56 --> 00:04:31,12
Do I know that name? It sounds familiar.
我認識這名字嗎?聽得很熟悉

58
00:04:31,33 --> 00:04:34,23
Well,it does not ring a bell with me.
我沒印象

59
00:04:34,97 --> 00:04:38,56
But you're more plugged into that show business thing.
但是你是深深陷在表演事業之中了啊

60
00:04:38,77 --> 00:04:41,80
Joe Stalin.
喬斯大林

61
00:04:44,11 --> 00:04:45,94
You know,that's pretty good.
這名字很好

62
00:04:46,61 --> 00:04:48,64
You might wanna try Joseph.
或許你想試試喬瑟夫

63
00:04:55,09 --> 00:04:56,78
Joseph Stalin.
喬瑟夫斯大林

64
00:04:58,13 --> 00:05:01,36
-I think you'd remember that. -Yes.
-我好像記得這個名字 -是的

65
00:05:02,16 --> 00:05:04,79
Bye Bye Birdie, starring Joseph Stalin.
「別了,鳥兒」喬瑟夫斯大林主演

66
00:05:05,03 --> 00:05:08,47
Joseph Stalin is the Fiddler on the Roof.
「屋頂上的提琴手」中的喬瑟夫斯大林

67
00:05:21,72 --> 00:05:24,31
Hi. Yes,this is Monica Geller.
對,我是摩妮卡蓋勒

68
00:05:24,52 --> 00:05:29,96
I'm taking some classes with you, and I was wondering what they were.
我想有在你們那裡上課,我想知道是哪些課

69
00:05:30,16 --> 00:05:34,19
I've had a recent head injury and certain numbers
我最近頭部受傷,只記得一些數字了

70
00:05:34,40 --> 00:05:40,10
Barbecue. Oh,did l? See,there you go.
野外烤肉.哦,我應該去嗎?好的

71
00:05:41,24 --> 00:05:44,30
-What are you doing? -All right,great.
-你在幹什麼? -太好了,謝謝

72
00:05:44,51 --> 00:05:48,44
Great. Thanks a lot. I'm going to tap class.
太棒了,非常感謝,我要去上踢踏舞課

73
00:05:48,64 --> 00:05:51,77
To dance with the woman that stole your card?
和偷你信用卡的人一起跳踢踏?

74
00:05:51,98 --> 00:05:53,74
To see what she looks like.
這樣你就可以知道她長什麼樣子

75
00:05:53,95 --> 00:05:56,61
I'm sure her picture's up at the post office.
我可以肯定她的照片就掛在郵局裡面

76
00:05:56,82 --> 00:05:59,34
I should get to see who she is.
我應該去看看她是何方神聖

77
00:05:59,55 --> 00:06:04,51
You're kind of losing it here. This is becoming a weird obsession.
摩妮卡,你有點失去理智了, 你被這件事所完全操控

78
00:06:04,73 --> 00:06:06,92
This is madness,I tell you.
我跟你說,這叫做瘋狂

79
00:06:07,13 --> 00:06:10,15
For the love of God,Monica, don't do it.
上帝保佑,摩妮卡別這麼做

80
00:06:12,87 --> 00:06:13,96
Thank you.
謝謝

81
00:06:22,04 --> 00:06:25,21
-What do you think? -Lots of things.
-你們怎麼認為? -很多

82
00:06:26,81 --> 00:06:29,15
-Which one is she? -May I help you?
-你認為是哪一個? -我能幫你們什麼嗎?

83
00:06:29,35 --> 00:06:32,18
No,thanks. We're just here to observe.
謝謝,我們是來參觀的

84
00:06:32,39 --> 00:06:36,22
You don't observe a dance class. You dance a dance class.
舞蹈課不是參觀來的,舞蹈課來跳舞的

85
00:06:36,49 --> 00:06:38,65
Spare shoes are over there.
那兒有舞鞋

86
00:06:41,10 --> 00:06:42,32
What does she mean?
什麼意思?

87
00:06:42,53 --> 00:06:46,26
I think she means "You dance a dance class."
我想她是叫我們進去跳

88
00:06:46,47 --> 00:06:49,40
-Come on,come on,come on. -Really?
-來吧,來吧,來吧 -真的?

89
00:06:50,47 --> 00:06:53,07
Do you see anybody you think could be me?
有看見我的分身嗎?

90
00:06:53,31 --> 00:06:57,97
Last time there were yogurt containers lying around after class.
各位,上回有人在教室留下酸乳空瓶

91
00:06:58,21 --> 00:07:02,44
-Let's not have that happen again. -She could be you.
-希望別再發生那種事 -她可能是你

92
00:07:07,26 --> 00:07:08,42
Let's get started.
開始吧

93
00:07:09,22 --> 00:07:12,49
Five,six. Five,six,seven,eight.
五,六,五,六,七,八

94
00:07:17,73 --> 00:07:22,43
-Okay,I'm not getting this. -I'm totally getting it.
-我跟不上 -我完全融人

95
00:07:27,04 --> 00:07:30,74
Do you ever feel like you're so uncoordinated?
你不會覺得,自己有時毫無協調感嗎?

96
00:07:38,69 --> 00:07:40,81
What? You click when they click.
怎麼了?只要他們踢的時候你踢就是了

97
00:07:42,66 --> 00:07:45,15
All right,everyone grab a partner.
各位找個舞伴

98
00:07:46,99 --> 00:07:51,99
All right. And my dead mother said you are it. I'm with Rachel.
我死去的媽說就是你,我和瑞秋

99
00:07:52,50 --> 00:07:55,09
Great,it's gym class all over again.
這下可好,體育課的舊事又重演了

100
00:07:57,34 --> 00:08:01,17
You can come up to the front and dance with me.
無所謂,你過來和我一起跳

101
00:08:01,98 --> 00:08:05,94
Why don't I just take off my clothes and have a nightmare?
我何不脫下衣服來場惡夢?

102
00:08:10,72 --> 00:08:15,28
It's okay,it's okay. I'm here, I'm here. I'm so sorry I'm late.
沒關係,我來了抱歉,我遲到

103
00:08:15,52 --> 00:08:19,52
Okay,here I am. So who's the new tense girl?
來了,那個緊張的新人是誰?

104
00:08:19,96 --> 00:08:23,16
-She's your partner. -Hi,I'm Monica.
-你的舞伴 -我叫摩妮卡

105
00:08:24,93 --> 00:08:26,80
Oh,Monica.
摩妮卡

106
00:08:28,77 --> 00:08:30,29
Hi,I'm Mon
我叫摩…

107
00:08:30,51 --> 00:08:32,34
-Nana. -Monana.
-…娜娜 -摩娜娜

108
00:08:34,84 --> 00:08:36,78
-It's Dutch. -You're kidding.
-是荷蘭人的名字 -你在開玩笑吧

109
00:08:36,98 --> 00:08:39,50
I spent three years in Amsterdam.
我在阿姆斯特丹住了三年

110
00:08:43,15 --> 00:08:44,55
Pennsylvania Dutch.
我是賓夕法尼亞州的荷蘭人

111
00:08:46,69 --> 00:08:51,22
And we're dancing. Five,six,seven,eight.
開始吧.五,六,七,八

112
00:08:58,13 --> 00:08:59,39
Hi.
嗨

113
00:09:01,44 --> 00:09:06,27
-Hey. Where have you been? -I just got back from the vet.
-你上哪兒去了 -我剛從獸醫回來

114
00:09:06,47 --> 00:09:10,34
She's not gonna make you wear a big plastic cone?
她沒叫你戴那種塑膠套吧?

115
00:09:13,15 --> 00:09:16,14
She says Marcel's humping is not a phase.
她說馬修亂性不是暫時的

116
00:09:16,42 --> 00:09:19,61
Apparently,he's reached sexual maturity.
顯然它已性成熟

117
00:09:20,52 --> 00:09:22,61
Hey,he beat you.
嘿,它超過你呢

118
00:09:26,33 --> 00:09:31,46
She says,as time goes on, he's gonna start getting violent.
她說它會越來越暴力,侵略性越來越強

119
00:09:31,80 --> 00:09:34,10
So,what does this mean?
這代表什麼?

120
00:09:35,40 --> 00:09:37,96
I have to give him up.
我們不能再養它了

121
00:09:51,55 --> 00:09:54,49
I can't believe it. This sucks.
我真不敢相信,這真是太扯了

122
00:09:54,69 --> 00:09:58,15
You just got him. How could he be an adult already?
我不懂,你才剛養它,它怎會突然成熟了?

123
00:09:58,39 --> 00:10:01,52
I know. One day he's this little thing...
我知道,之前它只是個小東西

124
00:10:01,73 --> 00:10:06,89
...and then he's this little thing I can't get off my leg.
不知不覺中它就緊抓住我的腿不放的小東西

125
00:10:08,80 --> 00:10:11,24
Isn't there any way to keep him?
你沒有任何辦法再飼養它嗎?

126
00:10:11,44 --> 00:10:14,34
No. The vet said unless he's in a place...
沒辦法,獸醫說除非有個地方…

127
00:10:14,58 --> 00:10:17,01
...where he has regular access...
…讓它獲得正常的…

128
00:10:17,81 --> 00:10:19,97
...to some monkey loving...
…猴愛

129
00:10:20,98 --> 00:10:23,08
... he's just gonna get vicious.
…否則它會變得愈來愈殘暴

130
00:10:23,35 --> 00:10:26,01
I just gotta get him into a zoo.
我得將它送到動物園

131
00:10:27,92 --> 00:10:31,86
-How do you get a monkey into a zoo? -I know.
-你如何把它送進動物園? -我知道

132
00:10:35,16 --> 00:10:38,13
No,that's popes into a Vokswagen.
不,那是教皇進入大眾汽車

133
00:10:39,83 --> 00:10:44,70
We're applying to a lot. Our first choice would be a big state zoo.
我們到處申請, 當然大型州立動物園是優先考慮

134
00:10:44,91 --> 00:10:48,77
You know,like San Diego. Right?
比方說聖地牙哥動物園

135
00:10:49,64 --> 00:10:53,71
But that may just be a pipe dream. He's out-of-state.
那可能只是遙不可及的夢想,因為它在加州

136
00:10:55,95 --> 00:11:00,28
My vet knows someone at Miami, so that's a possibility.
獸醫說她認識邁阿密的朋友,或許有可能

137
00:11:00,52 --> 00:11:05,25
But that's two blocks from the beach. It's a total party zoo.
那兒似乎離海灘只有兩條街, 一定是個瘋狂動物園

138
00:11:10,63 --> 00:11:12,26
We found the girl.
我們找到她了

139
00:11:12,47 --> 00:11:15,40
-Did you call the cops? -We took her to lunch.
-你們喊警察了嗎? -沒有,我們和她吃午餐

140
00:11:15,60 --> 00:11:19,30
Oh,your own brand of vigilante justice.
你們自己的「自治正義」

141
00:11:19,61 --> 00:11:22,77
Are you insane? This woman stole from you.
你瘋了?那女人偷了你的東西

142
00:11:22,98 --> 00:11:25,41
She stole. She's a stealer.
她偷東西,她是個小偷

143
00:11:26,38 --> 00:11:30,87
After you're with this woman for 10 minutes,you forget that.
和這女人相處十分鐘後, 你就會把這些全忘了

144
00:11:31,39 --> 00:11:36,12
I mean,she's this astounding person with this amazing spirit.
她簡直是奇女子,振奮人心

145
00:11:36,32 --> 00:11:39,49
Which she probably stole from some cheerleader.
她可能是從某位啦啦隊隊員那兒偷來的

146
00:11:41,90 --> 00:11:45,26
-Take off their hats. -Popes in a Vokswagen.
-脫下他們的帽子 -大眾車上的教皇

147
00:11:47,64 --> 00:11:49,40
I love that joke.
我喜歡這個笑話

148
00:11:53,11 --> 00:11:57,81
-No way. No way did you do this. -Monana was very brave.
-不可能,你不可能這麼做 -摩娜娜相當勇敢

149
00:11:58,68 --> 00:12:02,74
We told them we were the Gundersons in room 61 5...
我說我們是615房的岡氏姐妹

150
00:12:02,95 --> 00:12:07,08
...only to find out the Boston Celtics had the entire floor.
結果波士頓塞爾提克已包下整個六樓

151
00:12:07,29 --> 00:12:10,72
When they saw that we're short and have breasts....
他們知道我們又矮又有胸部時

152
00:12:11,43 --> 00:12:15,62
They threw us out. I was thrown out of a hotel. Me.
他們就把我們轟出來,我被轟出飯店,我

153
00:12:15,83 --> 00:12:17,13
Go,Monana.
幹得好,摩娜娜

154
00:12:19,27 --> 00:12:22,86
You ladies are not the only ones living the dream.
不是只有你們活在夢中

155
00:12:23,14 --> 00:12:27,87
I get to go pour coffee for people I don't know. Don't wait up.
我得去為我不認識的人倒咖啡,不用等我了

156
00:12:30,11 --> 00:12:31,31
Oh,by the way...
對了

157
00:12:31,61 --> 00:12:35,34
...tomorrow we're auditioning for a Broadway show.
明天我們要去參加百老匯的試演

158
00:12:36,32 --> 00:12:39,18
-Excuse me? -There's an open call for Cats.
-什麼? -「貓」劇還有一個缺額

159
00:12:39,39 --> 00:12:42,12
I'm thinking we sing "Memories"...
我想我們可以去唱「回憶」

160
00:12:42,36 --> 00:12:46,66
...and make complete fools of ourselves. What do you say?
讓自己當個傻子,如何?

161
00:12:46,86 --> 00:12:51,16
No,no,no. Remember who you're dealing with here.
不,記得你身旁的人是誰

162
00:12:51,37 --> 00:12:54,60
I can't even stand in front of a tap class.
我和你不一樣 我連站在踢踏舞教室前都有困難

163
00:12:54,80 --> 00:12:57,97
That's because of your Amish background.
因為你有阿米許的血統

164
00:12:59,27 --> 00:13:02,00
-What? -You're Pennsylvania Dutch,right?
-什麼? -你不是賓州荷蘭人嗎?

165
00:13:02,21 --> 00:13:06,67
Right. Till I bought a blow dryer. Then I was shunned.
對,直到我買了吹風機被逐出村裡

166
00:13:08,68 --> 00:13:14,25
I was just like you. And then,one day, I saw a movie that changed my life.
我過去也和你一樣 有一天我看了出改變我人生的電影

167
00:13:14,82 --> 00:13:17,31
Did you ever see Dead Poets Society?
看過春風化雨嗎?

168
00:13:17,53 --> 00:13:22,33
I thought that movie was so incredibly boring.
我認為這電影實在是太…無聊了

169
00:13:23,13 --> 00:13:25,69
That thing at the end where the kid...
那孩子在電影的結局時…

170
00:13:25,97 --> 00:13:29,93
...kills himself because he can't be in the play?
…自殺了.只因他無法演出話劇?

171
00:13:30,17 --> 00:13:36,17
It's like,"Kid,wait a year. Leave home,do some community theater."
這是在幹什麼? 他再等一年離家,到社區話劇團去

172
00:13:37,18 --> 00:13:43,41
I thought,"That's two hours of my life that I'm never getting back."
走出電影院時我想, 我這逝去兩小時的生命,永遠不再回

173
00:13:43,62 --> 00:13:48,11
That scared me more than all the other crap I was afraid to do.
這想法震驚了我,從此我便及時行樂

174
00:13:48,32 --> 00:13:52,62
Wow. Then I would definitely not recommend Mrs. Doubtfire.
那麼我不敢推薦「窈窕奶爸」了

175
00:13:59,50 --> 00:14:01,47
Oh,God.
上帝

176
00:14:02,64 --> 00:14:04,90
We didn't get into Scranton.
我們進不了斯克蘭頓了

177
00:14:06,97 --> 00:14:09,81
That was,like,our safety zoo.
那是我們保底的動物園

178
00:14:10,71 --> 00:14:13,87
They take,like,dogs and cows.
他們連狗和牛都收

179
00:14:16,22 --> 00:14:20,88
See,I don't know who this is harder on,me or him.
我不懂是我還是它比較難受

180
00:14:21,69 --> 00:14:24,68
I'd say that chair's taking the brunt of it.
我想應該椅子最可憐

181
00:14:26,99 --> 00:14:30,12
Marcel. Marcel. Marcel,no.
馬修,馬修,馬修…不

182
00:14:31,73 --> 00:14:35,57
Good boy. See? How can nobody want him?
乖,為何沒人要它?

183
00:14:35,84 --> 00:14:37,67
Somebody will.
一定有人會要的

184
00:14:40,67 --> 00:14:43,34
You know,there already is a Joseph Stalin.
早就有人叫喬瑟夫斯大林了

185
00:14:48,58 --> 00:14:50,95
You're kidding.
開什麼玩笑

186
00:14:51,15 --> 00:14:56,85
Apparently,he was this Russian dictator who slaughtered people.
顯然他是屠殺各種民族的俄國獨裁者

187
00:14:57,22 --> 00:15:01,72
-You'd think you would've known that. -You'd think I would've.
-你怎麼會不知道. -你怎麼認為我知道

188
00:15:02,00 --> 00:15:05,52
Hey,how about Joey Heatherton?
嗨,喬伊.漢密爾頓

189
00:15:06,20 --> 00:15:10,53
Come on,I told you I don't wanna go back to Joey.
拜託,我告訴過你不要用回喬伊

190
00:15:13,67 --> 00:15:17,63
What do you think a good stage name for me would be?
你認為我該取什麼藝名?

191
00:15:19,58 --> 00:15:20,91
Flame Boy.
火焰男孩

192
00:15:28,56 --> 00:15:30,28
Where exactly is your zoo?
你的動物園在哪兒?

193
00:15:30,49 --> 00:15:33,15
Well,it's technically not a zoo,per se.
就技術上而言不算是動物園

194
00:15:33,39 --> 00:15:37,49
It's more of an interactive wildlife experience.
而是一種互動式野生動物體驗

195
00:15:37,70 --> 00:15:40,79
Let me ask you some questions about Marcel.
我想請教你幾個關於馬修的問題

196
00:15:41,90 --> 00:15:47,43
-Does he fight with other animals? -No,no. He's very docile.
-它會和其他動物打架嗎? -不會的,它非常溫馴

197
00:15:47,64 --> 00:15:50,08
Even if he were cornered?
如果被逼進角落裡去時呢?

198
00:15:53,21 --> 00:15:55,55
Well,I don't know. Why?
我不知道,幹嘛問?

199
00:15:55,82 --> 00:15:58,84
How is he at handling small objects?
它掌控小東西的能力為何?

200
00:16:00,09 --> 00:16:03,61
He can hold a banana, if that's what you mean.
它會拿香蕉,如果你是這意思的話

201
00:16:04,12 --> 00:16:06,96
What about a hammer or a small blade?
鐵槌或小刀呢?

202
00:16:10,50 --> 00:16:13,36
Why would he need a blade?
為什麼?為何要小刀?

203
00:16:13,57 --> 00:16:16,43
If he's up against an animal with horns...
面對獅虎或有角的動物

204
00:16:16,64 --> 00:16:18,97
...you got to give him something.
你得拿些東西給它自我防衛

205
00:16:19,17 --> 00:16:21,40
Otherwise,it's just cruel.
否則就太殘忍了

206
00:16:24,24 --> 00:16:27,58
-He got into San Diego. -What?
-它能去聖地牙哥了 -什麼?

207
00:16:27,78 --> 00:16:31,24
We came back from our walk. The phone was ringing....
我們散步回來聲見電話鈴響

208
00:16:31,45 --> 00:16:32,48
He's in.
然後它就錄取了

209
00:16:32,69 --> 00:16:38,02
Did you hear that,Marcel? San Diego. San Diego.
聽見沒,馬修,是聖地牙哥

210
00:16:38,23 --> 00:16:41,22
You're making a mistake. San Diego's good...
你大錯特錯了,聖地牙哥環境良好沒錯

211
00:16:41,43 --> 00:16:44,92
... but I'll start him off against a blind rabbit...
如果你把它交給我 我就能訓練它對抗瞎眼的兔子

212
00:16:45,13 --> 00:16:47,90
...and give you 20% of the gate.
而且我還可以給你百分之二十的門票收入

213
00:17:08,36 --> 00:17:09,69
Where have you been?
你到底跑哪兒去了?

214
00:17:09,89 --> 00:17:13,05
Monica and I just crashed an embassy party.
我和摩妮卡剛跑去參加大使館舞會

215
00:17:14,09 --> 00:17:17,09
I think I kissed an archbishop.
我想我吻了大主教

216
00:17:18,43 --> 00:17:21,33
But,of course, it could've been a chef.
當然,他們有自己的廚師

217
00:17:23,10 --> 00:17:25,97
-Are you drunk? -No.
-你喝醉了? -才沒有呢

218
00:17:31,21 --> 00:17:36,44
-I'm lying. I am so drunk. -Oh,God.
-騙你的,我醉醺醺的 -天哪

219
00:17:36,65 --> 00:17:39,05
You know what? You could've called.
摩妮卡,你該打通電話回來的

220
00:17:39,25 --> 00:17:42,22
I've been worried Monica.
我一直在家裡擔心你

221
00:17:48,10 --> 00:17:50,00
Water rules.
好過癮

222
00:17:53,23 --> 00:17:55,10
Yes. Yes,it does.
沒錯

223
00:17:55,40 --> 00:17:59,46
The restaurant called. They wanna know if you're showing up for work.
餐廳今天又來電了, 他們想知道你還要不要去上班

224
00:17:59,94 --> 00:18:03,77
Nope. Going to the Big Apple Circus today.
不去.我今天要去大蘋果馬戲團

225
00:18:04,14 --> 00:18:08,01
You're gonna lose your job. This is not you.
你快丟掉工作了,你變了

226
00:18:08,22 --> 00:18:09,81
No,it is me.
不,這正是我

227
00:18:10,02 --> 00:18:13,32
I'm not just the person who fluffs the pillows...
我不只是那種必須拍松枕頭

228
00:18:13,59 --> 00:18:15,78
...and pays the bills right away.
帳單一來立刻去繳款的人

229
00:18:16,02 --> 00:18:20,98
You know,when I'm with her, I'm so much more than that.
和她在一起,我就超越了那種人

230
00:18:23,76 --> 00:18:25,60
I'm Monana.
我是摩娜娜

231
00:18:31,77 --> 00:18:36,11
Hello? Yes,she is. Hold on a second please.
對,她在,等等

232
00:18:36,38 --> 00:18:41,04
Monana,it's for you. The credit card people.
摩娜娜,你的電話,信用卡公司打來的

233
00:18:41,82 --> 00:18:43,48
Hello.
你好

234
00:18:45,42 --> 00:18:46,78
Yes?
是嗎?

235
00:18:48,09 --> 00:18:49,49
Oh,my God.
天那

236
00:18:50,96 --> 00:18:54,26
-Thanks. -What?
-謝謝. -怎麼啦?

237
00:18:55,26 --> 00:18:57,89
They've arrested Monica.
他們已逮到摩妮卡

238
00:19:08,28 --> 00:19:10,47
-Hi. -Hi.
-嗨.-嗨

239
00:19:10,68 --> 00:19:12,30
How are you?
你好嗎?

240
00:19:12,51 --> 00:19:16,04
Not too bad. Fortunately,blue's my color.
不太糟,幸好我喜歡藍色

241
00:19:16,52 --> 00:19:18,58
How did you know I was here?
你怎會知道我在這兒?

242
00:19:19,89 --> 00:19:24,42
Because I'm Monica Geller.
因為我是摩妮卡蓋勒

243
00:19:25,16 --> 00:19:27,65
It was my credit card you were using.
你用的是我的信用卡

244
00:19:28,06 --> 00:19:30,33
That I was not expecting.
真是沒想到

245
00:19:30,53 --> 00:19:33,99
I want you to know, I didn't turn you in.
我想讓你知道,去報案的人不是我

246
00:19:35,27 --> 00:19:37,86
-Thanks. -No,thank you.
-謝謝你 -不,我要謝謝你

247
00:19:38,31 --> 00:19:40,54
You have given me so much.
你帶給我太多了

248
00:19:40,74 --> 00:19:42,97
I'd never have gotten to sing...
如果不是你,我就不可能…

249
00:19:43,18 --> 00:19:45,84
... "Memories" at the Winter Garden Theater.
…在冬園劇場唱「回憶」

250
00:19:46,05 --> 00:19:49,21
Actually,you only got to sing "Memo"
老實說你只開口唱了「回」而已

251
00:19:50,55 --> 00:19:54,45
I can't believe you're here. What will I do without you?
我不敢相信你會在這兒 失去你我該怎麼辦?

252
00:19:54,69 --> 00:19:57,12
Who's gonna crash parties with me?
誰會和我去大使館宴會

253
00:19:57,36 --> 00:20:00,19
Who's gonna take me to the Big Apple Circus?
誰帶我去大蘋果馬戲團?

254
00:20:00,39 --> 00:20:04,52
I started my day by peeing in front of 25 other women...
我在25個女人面前尿尿展開一天的生活

255
00:20:04,80 --> 00:20:09,00
...and you're worried about who'll take you to the circus?
你卻擔心沒人帶你去看馬戲?

256
00:20:10,30 --> 00:20:13,97
Well,not worried, you know,just wondering.
不是擔心,只是懷疑

257
00:20:14,17 --> 00:20:16,67
There's nothing to wonder about.
沒什麼好懷疑的

258
00:20:16,88 --> 00:20:20,90
You'll go back to being who you were. That's who you are.
你繼續做你自己,因為那才是真正的你

259
00:20:21,15 --> 00:20:23,55
-Not necessarily. -Yes,necessarily.
-那沒必要呀 -那很必要

260
00:20:23,75 --> 00:20:27,58
I don't know what it is. Maybe it's the Amish thing.
我不知道是為什麼 或許和你是阿米許人有關

261
00:20:30,76 --> 00:20:36,70
-I'm not actually Amish. -Really? Then why are you like that?
-我不是阿米許人 -真的?為何你那麼怪?

262
00:20:51,75 --> 00:20:56,44
-You,by the door,in or out? -ln.
-門旁的那個,加不加入? -加人

263
00:21:01,86 --> 00:21:06,02
-You're getting it all wrong. -But at least I'm doing it.
-後面的,你完全跳錯了 -至少我在跳

264
00:21:20,71 --> 00:21:24,47
This is the final boarding call for Flight 67...
這是飛往聖地牙哥67次航班的

265
00:21:24,78 --> 00:21:26,94
... to San Diego at gate 42A.
最後一次登機通知

266
00:21:27,21 --> 00:21:32,91
Okay,goodbye,little monkey guy. All right,I wrote you this poem.
再見,猴子小伙.好的,我會給你寫詩的

267
00:21:33,12 --> 00:21:36,25
Okay,but don't eat it till you get on the plane.
上飛機後才能吃

268
00:21:36,46 --> 00:21:38,92
Thank you,Aunt Phoebe.
謝謝你,菲比阿姨

269
00:21:42,43 --> 00:21:44,73
Okay,bye,champ.
再見了

270
00:21:44,93 --> 00:21:47,83
There'll be a lot of babes in San Diego...
我知道聖地牙哥那兒,你將有許多漂亮美眉

271
00:21:48,04 --> 00:21:51,63
... but remember, there's also a lot to learn.
記得要學習的也很多

272
00:21:57,41 --> 00:22:00,90
I don't know what to say,Ross. It's a monkey.
我不知該說什麼,羅斯,它是一隻猴子

273
00:22:01,11 --> 00:22:04,55
Just say what you feel,Joey.
說出你的感覺就成了

274
00:22:05,59 --> 00:22:09,04
-Marcel,I'm hungry. -That was good.
-馬修,我餓了 -這句不錯

275
00:22:12,36 --> 00:22:14,85
Marcel,this is for you.
馬修,這是給你的

276
00:22:15,06 --> 00:22:19,52
It's just,you know,something...
給你,你知道的

277
00:22:19,73 --> 00:22:22,03
...to do on the plane.
在飛機上玩的

278
00:22:24,17 --> 00:22:27,44
If you don't mind, I'd like a moment alone.
如果不介意我想和它獨處

279
00:22:27,64 --> 00:22:30,63
-Oh,sure. Absolutely. -Go ahead.
-當然可以. -繼續

280
00:22:35,58 --> 00:22:40,08
Marcel,come here. Come here. Come here.
馬修,過來,過來,過來

281
00:22:40,29 --> 00:22:42,26
Well,buddy...
小兄弟

282
00:22:43,99 --> 00:22:45,65
...this is it.
就這樣了

283
00:22:45,86 --> 00:22:48,92
Just a couple of things I wanted to say.
我只想說幾句話

284
00:22:50,16 --> 00:22:52,89
I'm really gonna miss you.
我會想你的

285
00:22:53,10 --> 00:22:55,93
You know,I'm never gonna forget about you.
我不會忘記你的

286
00:22:56,14 --> 00:23:01,04
You've been more than just a pet to me.
在我心中你不只是一隻寵物

287
00:23:01,24 --> 00:23:04,87
You've been more like a Okay. Marcel.
你更是…馬修

288
00:23:05,55 --> 00:23:07,88
Would you leave my leg alone?
能放開我的腿嗎?

289
00:23:08,08 --> 00:23:11,18
Would you stop humping me for two seconds?
能暫時不要亂來嗎?

290
00:23:11,39 --> 00:23:15,75
Okay,would you just take him away? Just take him.
馬修…帶它走好嗎?帶它走

291
00:23:37,61 --> 00:23:41,38
Oh,that I were a glove upon that hand...
希望我是你手上的手套

292
00:23:41,58 --> 00:23:45,02
...that I might touch thy cheek.
這樣我就能撫摸你的臉頰

293
00:23:45,22 --> 00:23:50,25
-That's fine. Thank you. -Next.
-行,謝謝. -下一位

294
00:23:53,79 --> 00:23:56,49
I'll be reading for the role of Mercutio.
我來試演「馬丘修」角色的

295
00:23:56,70 --> 00:23:59,79
-Name? -Holden McGroin.
-名字? -麥克葛羅尼

296
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


297
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


